{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy-style Galgame with dual heroines and two possible endings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an era of conflict between humans and demonkind, you embark on a journey to defeat the Demon King alongside your former knight companion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the kingdom, political undercurrents and clashes of faith intertwine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the journey progresses, you witness and take part in the struggle between light and darkness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich and expansive world stage  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >makes the entire story feel like an RPG journey infused with romantic elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love fantasy themes are warmly welcome to dive in and experience it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100060?t=1768145230","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100060/8d85dafc7b3377802ab5651c4c07038f8fe48b9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768145230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100060/91b95ff55fffd4b24669e5be1e9174073378e6c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768145230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100060/91b95ff55fffd4b24669e5be1e9174073378e6c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768145230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy-style Galgame with dual heroines and two possible endings.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an era of conflict between humans and demonkind, you embark on a journey to defeat the Demon King alongside your former knight companion.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the kingdom, politica